 presents the individual receipt and appropriation accounts at the detail level. Annual Report single copy price: $2; Appendix free from Financial Management Service.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [90, 1541, 802, 1581], \"page_id\": 6}], \"content\": \"\\u2020 Subscription order form on inside back cover of this issue.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [92, 1757, 681, 1815], \"page_id\": 6}], \"content\": \"ON THE COVER: A line drawing from an old photograph of Treasury's West Portico, looking toward the Washington Monument.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [106, 54, 1358, 1663], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": null, \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"figure\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [181, 1692, 1295, 1726], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": \"Office of the Secretary \\u2022 Department of the Treasury \\u2022 Washington, D.C.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [381, 1886, 1100, 1936], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": \"The Treasury Bulletin is for sale by the Superintendent of Documents, U.S. Government Printing Office, Washington, D.C. 20402\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [173, 1770, 1330, 1899], \"page_id\": 8}], \"content\": \"The Treasury Bulletin is issued quarterly in March, June, September, and December by the Financial Management Service. The Reports Management Division, Financial Information compiles articles of general interest and statistical data from sources within several Treasury departmental offices and bureaus. Users can contact the Financial Reports Branch at (202) 208-1709 to inquire about any of the published information.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [642, 121, 897, 199], \"page_id\": 9}], \"content\": \"Contents\", \"description\"