ished information. Suggestions for article subjects, tables or graphs are welcome.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [382, 1265, 669, 1288], \"page_id\": 4}], \"content\": \"TREASURY BULLETIN STAFF\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [165, 1314, 512, 1336], \"page_id\": 4}], \"content\": \"Editor-In-Chief: Regina M. Dennis-Downing\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [290, 1332, 759, 1378], \"page_id\": 4}], \"content\": \"Assistant Editor: Stephen T. Wiley\\nEditorial Assistants: Bertha M. Butts and Bernice T. James\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [870, 1312, 886, 1327], \"page_id\": 4}], \"content\": null, \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"figure\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [453, 194, 646, 235], \"page_id\": 5}], \"content\": \"Contents\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"title\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [933, 247, 1055, 272], \"page_id\": 5}], \"content\": \"MARCH 1992\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [45, 303, 235, 325], \"page_id\": 5}], \"content\": \"TREASURY ISSUES\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [980, 330, 1021, 351], \"page_id\": 5}], \"content\": \"Page\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [45, 375, 176, 395], \"page_id\": 5}], \"content\": \"TRADE AND AID\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [45, 397, 1025, 462], \"page_id\": 5}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>OECD Economic Agreement Expected to Help U.S. Exporters.</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Interview with Treasury Deputy Assistant Secretary for Trade and Investment Policy William E. Barreda;</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Statement to Congress on new agreement by Director of the Office