and Published by Financial Management Service\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [118, 402, 1314, 500], \"page_id\": 6}], \"content\": \"ADDITIONAL FINANCIAL MANAGEMENT SERVICE RELEASES ON FEDERAL FINANCES\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [90, 573, 1341, 653], \"page_id\": 6}], \"content\": \"Sold on a subscription basis only (exceptions noted) by the Superintendent of Documents, U.S. Government Printing Office, Washington, D.C. 20402.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [188, 731, 1312, 848], \"page_id\": 6}], \"content\": \"Daily Treasury Statement. Provides summary data on the Treasury's cash and debt operations for the Federal Government. Published each Federal working day. Subscription price: $174 per year (domestic), $217.50 per year (foreign).\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [188, 877, 1317, 1077], \"page_id\": 6}], \"content\": \"Monthly Treasury Statement of Receipts and Outlays of the United States Government. Provides Federal budget results, including receipts and outlays of funds, the surplus or deficit, and the means of financing the deficit or disposing of the surplus. Preparation based on agency reporting. Subscription price: $22 per year (domestic), $27.50 per year (foreign).\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [188, 1106, 1281, 1226], \"page_id\": 6}], \"content\": \"Consolidated Financial Statements of the United States Government (annual). Provides information about Government financial operations on the accrual basis. Single copy price: $2.50.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [188, 1257, 1337, 1415], \"page_id\": 6}], \"content\": \"United States Government Annual Report and Appendix. Annual Report presents budgetary results at the summary level. Appendix presents the individual receipt and appropriation accounts at the detail level. Annual Report single copy price: $2; Appendix free from Financial Management Service.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [90, 1541, 802, 1581], \"page_id\": 6}], \"content\": \"\\u2020 Subscription order form on inside back cover of this issue.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [92, 1757, 681, 1815], \"page_id\": 6}], \"content\": \"ON THE COVER: A line drawing from an old photograph of Treasury's West Portico, looking toward the Washington Monument.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [106, 54, 1358, 1663], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": null, \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"figure\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [181, 1692, 1295, 1726], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": \"Office of the Secretary \\u2022 Department of the Treasury \\u2022 Washington, D.C.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [381, 1886, 1100, 1936], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": \"The Treasury Bulletin is for sale by the Superintendent of Documents, U.S. Government Printing Office, Washington, D.C. 20402\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [173, 1770, 1330, 1899], \"page_id\": 8}], \"content\": \"The Treasury Bulletin is issued quarterly in March, June, September, and December by the Financial Management Service. The Reports Management Division, Financial Information compiles articles of general interest and statistical data from sources within several Treasury departmental offices and bureaus. Users can contact the Financial Reports Branch at (202) 208-1709 to inquire about any of the published information.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [642, 121, 897, 199], \"page_id\": 9}], \"content\": \"Contents\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1083, 283, 1440, 314], \"page_id\": 9}], \"content\": \"WINTER ISSUE, MARCH 1991\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [93, 358, 345, 387], \"page_id\": 9}], \"content\": \"TREASURY ISSUES\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [91, 395, 1405, 596], \"page_id\": 9}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>ECONOMIC POLICY</td><td>Page</td></tr><tr><td>The Need for Reform in the Financial Markets</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>TREASURY ISSUES INDEX</td><td>7</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [91, 656, 430, 685], \"page_id\": 9}], \"content\": \"FINANCIAL OPERATIONS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [91, 722, 425, 749], \"page_id\": 9}], \"content\": \"FEDERAL FISCAL OPERATIONS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [90, 773, 1405, 983], \"page_id\": 9}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>Analysis.--Budget results for the first quarter, fiscal 1991</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>FFO-1.--Summary of fiscal operations</td><td>17</td></tr><tr><td>Chart.--Monthly receipts and outlays</td><td>18</td></tr><tr><td>FFO-2.--On-budget and off-budget receipts by source</td><td>19</td></tr><tr><td>Chart.--Budget receipts by source</td><td>21</td></tr><tr><td>FFO-3.--On-budget and off-budget outlays by agency</td><td>22</td></tr><tr><td>FFO-4.--Summary of internal revenue collections by States and other areas</td><td>24</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [91, 1007, 350, 1034], \"page_id\": 9}], \"content\": \"FEDERAL OBLIGATIONS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [91, 1065, 1400, 1153], \"page_id\": 9}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>FO-1